{title: When The Saints Go Marching In}
{composer: Traditional}
{key: C}
{genre: Spiritual}
{language: English}

{section: Chorus}
Oh when the [C]saints go marching [E7]in
Oh when the [F]saints go marching [C]in
Oh Lord I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number
When the [C]saints go [G7]marching [C]in

{section: Verse 1}
Oh when the [C]sun refuse to [E7]shine
Oh when the [F]sun refuse to [C]shine
Oh Lord I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number
When the [C]sun re[G7]fuse to [C]shine

{section: Verse 2}
Oh when the [C]trumpet sounds its [E7]call
Oh when the [F]trumpet sounds its [C]call
Oh Lord I [C]want to [C7]be in that [F]number
When the [C]trumpet [G7]sounds its [C]call
